ustrial applications, including:<ul data-sourcepos=\\\"9:5-9:72\\\"><li data-sourcepos=\\\"9:5-9:72\\\"><strong>Biodiesel production:<\\/strong> TPO is a popular feedstock for biodiesel, a renewable fuel alternative.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"10:5-10:139\\\"><strong>Oleochemicals:<\\/strong> TPO is used as a raw material for the production of oleochemicals, such as fatty acids, glycerin, and surfactants.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"11:5-11:139\\\"><strong>Lubricants and greases:<\\/strong> TPO can be used as a base oil for lubricants and greases, providing excellent performance and durability.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"12:5-12:115\\\"><strong>Food processing:<\\/strong> TPO is used as an ingredient in certain food products, such as margarine and shortening.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"13:1-14:0\\\"><strong>Sustainability:<\\/strong> Our TPO is sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1b446bb\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":34.1880000000000023874235921539366245269775390625,\"_inline_size_tablet\":100,\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"60\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dd47c51\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"project-info\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"title\\\">Services:<\\/span>\\n    <span class=\\\"info\\\">Organic Solutions<\\/span>\\n    <span class=\\\"title\\\">Farmer:<\\/span>\\n    <span class=\\\"info\\\">Mike Hardson<\\/span>\\n    <span class=\\\"title\\\">Duration:<\\/span>\\n    <span class=\\\"info\\\">4.5 Months<\\/span>\\n    <span class=\\\"title\\\">Location:<\\/span>\\n    <span class=\\\"info\\\">Broklyn, New Your<\\/span>\\n    <div class=\\\"master-social-icons\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"#\\\" ari