hich is then cooked to facilitate oil extraction.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"9:1-9:31\\\"><strong>Oil Extraction:<\\/strong> We employ efficient oil extraction methods, such as expeller pressing or solvent extraction, to obtain the highest possible yield of crude palm oil.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"10:1-10:176\\\"><strong>Oil Refining:<\\/strong> Our refining process removes impurities and contaminants from the crude palm oil, resulting in a refined product that meets international quality standards.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"11:1-12:0\\\"><strong>By-Product Utilization:<\\/strong> We maximize the value of by-products such as palm kernel oil and palm fiber, ensuring sustainable and efficient resource utilization.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"78a941d\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1540,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7db3612\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5793c0a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":110,\"sizes\":[]},\"space_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":80,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"f32801b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"align\":\"center\",\"pre\":\"Other Services\",\"heading\":\"\",\"sub\":\"\",\"heading_bottom_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"mae-headings\"},{\"id\":\"3d21993\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"url_text\":\"Read More\",\"column\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]},\"column_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]},\"column_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"mae-project-related\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
