\"><li data-sourcepos=\\\"9:5-9:72\\\"><strong>Biodiesel production:<\\/strong> TPO is a popular feedstock for biodiesel, a renewable fuel alternative.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"10:5-10:139\\\"><strong>Oleochemicals:<\\/strong> TPO is used as a raw material for the production of oleochemicals, such as fatty acids, glycerin, and surfactants.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"11:5-11:139\\\"><strong>Lubricants and greases:<\\/strong> TPO can be used as a base oil for lubricants and greases, providing excellent performance and durability.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"12:5-12:115\\\"><strong>Food processing:<\\/strong> TPO is used as an ingredient in certain food products, such as margarine and shortening.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"13:1-14:0\\\"><strong>Sustainability:<\\/strong> Our TPO is sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"9987b91\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1540,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4bb1783\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"64cc116\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":110,\"sizes\":[]},\"space_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":80,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"cac22fc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"align\":\"center\",\"pre\":\"Other Services\",\"heading\":\"\",\"sub\":\"\",\"heading_bottom_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"mae-headings\"},{\"id\":\"c3a6a0d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"url_text\":\"Read More\",\"column\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]},\"column_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]