(3547, 3216, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"c68ecef\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2fb949f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5c73909\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image_rounded\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"thumbnail\":\"agrios-project-standard\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"mae-post-featured_image\"},{\"id\":\"fdd0e59\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"20\",\"reverse_order_tablet\":\"reverse-tablet\",\"reverse_order_mobile\":\"reverse-mobile\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5ca100d\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":65.8119999999999976125764078460633754730224609375,\"_inline_size_tablet\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1f6342a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"mae-post-content-title\"},{\"id\":\"0f9b876\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-sourcepos=\\\"3:1-3:109\\\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms<\\/strong> offers high-quality palm kernels, a valuable by-product of palm oil production. Our palm kernels are extracted from palm fruits and processed to ensure maximum purity and nutritional content.<\\/p><p data-sourcepos=\\\"5:1-5:37\\\"><strong>Key Features of Our Palm Kernels:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul data-sourcepos=\\\"7:1-7:27\\\"><li data-sourcepos=\\\"7:1-7:27\\\"><strong>High Oil Content:<\\/strong> Our palm kernels are rich in palm kernel oil, a valuable edible oil with a wide range of applications.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"8:1-8:66\\\"><strong>Nutritional Value:<\\/strong> Palm kernels are a good source of dietary fiber, vitamins, and minerals.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"9:1-10:49\\\"><strong>Versatility:<\\/strong> Palm kernels can be used in various applications, including:<ul data-sourcepos=\\\"10:5-10:49\\\"><li data-sourcepos=\\\"10:5-10:49\\\"><strong>Palm kernel oil production:<\\/strong> Palm kernel oil is used in cooking, baking, and the production of cosmetics and detergents.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"11:5-11:90\\\"><strong>Animal feed:<\\/strong> Palm kernels can be used as a nutritious ingredient in animal feed.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"12:5-12:105\\\"><strong>Biofuel production:<\\/strong> Palm kernel oil can be used as a feedstock for the production of biodiesel.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"13:1-14:0\\\"><strong>Sustainability:<\\/strong> Our palm kernels are sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.<\\/li><\\/ul><p><span style=\\\"color: #1f1e17;\\\"><b>\\\\<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"af58f66\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Challenges\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":26,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"27\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"36\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c03ad7f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"list\":[{\"title\":\"Nemo enim ipsam voluptatem quia voluptas.\",\"_id\":\"8864043\",\"icon_font\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-arrow-circle-right\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"}},{\"title\":\"Accusamus et iusto odio dignissimos ducimus.\",\"icon_font\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-arrow-circle-right\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"311e2cf\"},{\"title\":\"Nam liberto tempore, cum soluta nobis est elidend.\",\"icon_font\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-arrow-circle-right\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"d846fac\"},{\"title\":\"Accusamus et iusto odio di