(4716, 3343, 'metform_entries__form_data', 'a:3:{s:16:\"mf-listing-fname\";s:23:\"Alero Abimbola Adebayo \";s:8:\"mf-email\";s:24:\"henryagrofoods@gmail.com\";s:11:\"mf-textarea\";s:700:\"Good day Sir/Ma,\r\nTrust this mail meets you well.\r\n\r\nWe read about your Palmoil mill online and we got interested to join your company as one of your customers.\r\nWe. want to know requirements to be one of your customers \r\n\r\nWe are Henry Agro Foods , a young and growing safe healthy Foods processing and packaging company based in Lagos and \r\nPalmoil is one of our products \r\n\r\nWe want to be one of your customers to distribute your Palmoil into Nigerians and African kitchen.\r\n\r\nWe will like to know the requirements against the forthcoming Palmoil season.\r\n\r\nWe will appreciate hearing favourably from you soon \r\n\r\n\r\nYours Sincerely \r\nAlero Abimbola Adebayo \r\n\r\nFounder of Henry Agro Foods Limited \";}'),
