(4811, 3346, 'metform_entries__form_data', 'a:3:{s:16:\"mf-listing-fname\";s:18:\"BENSON  EMEKE JUDE\";s:8:\"mf-email\";s:22:\"judebenson80@yahoo.com\";s:11:\"mf-textarea\";s:503:\"Good Morning, \r\nI am Jude Emeke Benson, a staff of NIRSAL PLC, Asaba branch. NIRSAL is an acronym  that stands for Nigeria Incentives-based Risk Sharing  System  for Agricultural Lending. NIRSAL PLC is an initiative of the  Central  Bank of Nigeria (CBN) that  offer wide range of services to  to Agricultural  sector. So we are willing to partner with your  company.\r\nOur Asaba office is in the CBN building along Marian Babangida Road Asaba.\r\nMy phone number is 08068442722 or 08088447655.\r\nThank you.\";}'),
