(4994, 3348, 'metform_entries__form_data', 'a:3:{s:16:\"mf-listing-fname\";s:7:\"Onyeka \";s:8:\"mf-email\";s:25:\"maureenokwusogu@yahoo.com\";s:11:\"mf-textarea\";s:297:\"Good day! I want to start a palm oil business and as I was doing my research, I came across Norswothy Farms. How do I go about the it. I would like to know more about how to be in business with you. I live in Lagos. You can reach me on 07035469050. I will be waiting for your response. Thank you! \";}'),
