(5084, 3350, 'metform_entries__form_data', 'a:3:{s:16:\"mf-listing-fname\";s:5:\"Nduka\";s:8:\"mf-email\";s:20:\"lakeduck04@yahoo.com\";s:11:\"mf-textarea\";s:268:\"Hello, \r\nWe are interested in buying Palm kernel cake (PKC) from your company in very large quantity, at least 300 tons per week. \r\nWe will appreciate your feedback on your any information that will help facilitate the smooth flow of the transaction on a regular basis\";}'),
