(5140, 3357, 'metform_entries__form_data', 'a:3:{s:16:\"mf-listing-fname\";s:12:\"DOCOA FARMS \";s:8:\"mf-email\";s:25:\"docoa.companies@gmail.com\";s:11:\"mf-textarea\";s:760:\"We are an agro food and edible oils supplier located in Port Harcourt City, Nigeria.\r\nWe are interested in purchasing palm oil in wholesale quantities and would like to inquire about your current pricing.\r\nCould you please provide us with a price list or a quotation for the following:\r\n   - 25-liter jerry cans\r\n   - Bulk quantities (e.g., drums, tankers - please specify your available bulk sizes)\r\nAdditionally, please include information on the following:\r\n   - Minimum order quantities (MOQ)\r\n   - Available payment terms\r\n   - Your delivery options and lead time\r\n   - Any available specifications or grades of palm oil you offer\r\nWe are looking to establish a long-term partnership with a reliable supplier, and we look forward to hearing from you soon.\";}'),
