(5577, 510, '_elementor_element_cache', '{\"timeout\":1788559256,\"value\":{\"content\":\"\\t\\t<section class=\\\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c68ecef elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\\\" data-id=\\\"c68ecef\\\" data-element_type=\\\"section\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2fb949f\\\" data-id=\\\"2fb949f\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t[elementor-element data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<section class=\\\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-fdd0e59 elementor-reverse-tablet elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\\\" data-id=\\\"fdd0e59\\\" data-element_type=\\\"section\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-5ca100d\\\" data-id=\\\"5ca100d\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t[elementor-element data=\\\"eyJpZCI6IjFmNjM0MmEiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6W10sImVsZW1lbnRzIjpbXSwid2lkZ2V0VHlwZSI6Im1hZS1wb3N0LWNvbnRlbnQtdGl0bGUifQ==\\\"]\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f9b876 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\\\" data-id=\\\"0f9b876\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"text-editor.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p data-sourcepos=\\\"3:1-3:109\\\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms<\\/strong> offers high-quality palm kernels, a valuable by-product of palm oil production. Our palm kernels are extracted from palm fruits and processed to ensure maximum purity and nutritional content.<\\/p><p data-sourcepos=\\\"5:1-5:37\\\"><strong>Key Features of Our Palm Kernels:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul data-sourcepos=\\\"7:1-7:27\\\"><li data-sourcepos=\\\"7:1-7:27\\\"><strong>High Oil Content:<\\/strong> Our palm kernels are rich in palm kernel oil, a valuable edible oil with a wide range of applications.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"8:1-8:66\\\"><strong>Nutritional Value:<\\/strong> Palm kernels are a good source of dietary fiber, vitamins, and minerals.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"9:1-10:49\\\"><strong>Versatility:<\\/strong> Palm kernels can be used in various applications, including:<ul data-sourcepos=\\\"10:5-10:49\\\"><li data-sourcepos=\\\"10:5-10:49\\\"><strong>Palm kernel oil production:<\\/strong> Palm kernel oil is used in cooking, baking, and the production of cosmetics and detergents.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"11:5-11:90\\\"><strong>Animal feed:<\\/strong> Palm kernels can be used as a nutritious ingredient in animal feed.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"12:5-12:105\\\"><strong>Biofuel production:<\\/strong> Palm kernel oil can be used as a feedstock for the production of biodiesel.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"13:1-14:0\\\"><strong>Sustainability:<\\/strong> Our palm kernels are sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.<\\/li><\\/ul><p><span style=\\\"color: #1f1e17;\\\"><b>\\\\<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-cad0b23 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\\\" data-id=\\\"cad0b23\\\" data-element_type=\\\"section\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6cc9309\\\" data-id=\\\"6cc9309\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t[elementor-element data=\\\"eyJpZCI6ImRkYTYyOTEiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6eyJhbGlnbiI6ImNlbnRlciIsInByZSI6Ik90aGVyIFNlcnZpY2VzIiwiaGVhZGluZyI6IiIsInN1YiI6IiIsImhlYWRpbmdfYm90dG9tX3NwYWNlIjp7InVuaXQiOiJweCIsInNpemUiOjUwLCJzaXplcyI6W119fSwiZWxlbWVudHMiOltdLCJ3aWRnZXRUeXBlIjoibWFlLWhlYWRpbmdzIn0=\\\"][elementor-element data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/section>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}'),
