(5592, 607, '_elementor_element_cache', '{\"timeout\":1788483004,\"value\":{\"content\":\"\\t\\t<section class=\\\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4392e6b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\\\" data-id=\\\"4392e6b\\\" data-element_type=\\\"section\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4d70315\\\" data-id=\\\"4d70315\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t[elementor-element data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<section class=\\\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-04846cf elementor-reverse-tablet elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\\\" data-id=\\\"04846cf\\\" data-element_type=\\\"section\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3572000\\\" data-id=\\\"3572000\\\" data-element_type=\\\"column\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t[elementor-element data=\\\"eyJpZCI6IjI4MmU2MDMiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6W10sImVsZW1lbnRzIjpbXSwid2lkZ2V0VHlwZSI6Im1hZS1wb3N0LWNvbnRlbnQtdGl0bGUifQ==\\\"]\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5d1717 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\\\" data-id=\\\"a5d1717\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"text-editor.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-widget-container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p data-sourcepos=\\\"3:1-3:118\\\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms<\\/strong> offers comprehensive CPO processing services that transform raw palm fruit into valuable products. Our state-of-the-art processing facilities are equipped with advanced technology to ensure efficient and high-quality output.<\\/p><p data-sourcepos=\\\"5:1-5:36\\\"><strong>Our Processing Services Include:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul data-sourcepos=\\\"7:1-7:1\\\"><li data-sourcepos=\\\"7:1-7:1\\\"><strong>Fruit Sterilization:<\\/strong> We utilize modern sterilization techniques to eliminate harmful microorganisms and preserve the quality of the palm fruit.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"8:1-8:34\\\"><strong>Fruit Threshing and Cooking:<\\/strong> The fruits are thoroughly threshed to extract the oil-rich mesocarp, which is then cooked to facilitate oil extraction.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"9:1-9:31\\\"><strong>Oil Extraction:<\\/strong> We employ efficient oil extraction methods, such as expeller pressing or solvent extraction, to obtain the highest possible yield of crude palm oil.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"10:1-10:176\\\"><strong>Oil Refining:<\\/strong> Our refining process removes impurities and contaminants from the crude palm oil, resulting in a refined product that meets international quality standards.<\\/li><li data-sourcepos=\\\"11:1-12:0\\\"><strong>By-Product Utilization:<\\/strong> We maximize the value of by-products such as palm kernel oil and palm fiber, ensuring sustainable and efficient resource utilization.<\\/li><\\/ul>\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<\\/section>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-78a941d elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\\\" data-id=\\\"78a941d\\\" data-element_type=\\\"section\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-c