ur Introductions\n	        	        <h2>Norsworthy Farms & Agro Allied Industries</h2>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Improving availability of agricultural products.</h2>		\n		<p>We provide our customers with quality agricultural products on demand and at competitive prices, through our commitment to sustainable environmental practices, technology driven innovations and consistent community engagements.</p>		\n        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/about/\" \n            >\n                                        Discover More\n                                        Discover More\n                    </a>\n									<img width=\"1920\" height=\"410\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats.webp 1920w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-600x128.webp 600w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-300x64.webp 300w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-1024x219.webp 1024w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-768x164.webp 768w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-1536x328.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\n				        	        	Our Services\n	        	        <h2>What We Offer</h2>\n                        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/service/agriculture-products/\">\n		Read More\n		Discover More\n</a>                    \n                            <img width=\"270\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-01.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-01.webp 270w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-01-253x300.webp 253w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 270px) 100vw, 270px\" />\n                    <h3>Agriculture<br> Products</h3>                \n                        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/service/organic-products/\">\n		Read More\n		Discover More\n</a>                    \n                            <img width=\"270\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-02.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-02.webp 270w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-02-253x300.webp 253w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 270px) 100vw, 270px\" />\n                    <h3>Organic <br> Products</h3>                \n                        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/service/fresh-vegetables/\">\n		Read More\n		Discover More\n</a>                    \n                            <img width=\"270\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-03.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-03.webp 270w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-03-253x300.webp 253w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 270px) 100vw, 270px\" />\n                    <h3>Fresh<br> Vegetables</h3>                \n                        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/service/dairy-product/\">\n		Read More\n		Discover More\n</a>                    \n                            <img width=\"27