(510, 1, '2022-07-04 08:48:57', '2022-07-04 08:48:57', '<a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/healthy-food/\"><img width=\"1170\" height=\"520\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/img-product-PK-01-1170x520.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>		\n			<h1>Healthy Food</h1>		\n		<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:109\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> offers high-quality palm kernels, a valuable by-product of palm oil production. Our palm kernels are extracted from palm fruits and processed to ensure maximum purity and nutritional content.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:37\"><strong>Key Features of Our Palm Kernels:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:27\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:27\"><strong>High Oil Content:</strong> Our palm kernels are rich in palm kernel oil, a valuable edible oil with a wide range of applications.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:66\"><strong>Nutritional Value:</strong> Palm kernels are a good source of dietary fiber, vitamins, and minerals.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-10:49\"><strong>Versatility:</strong> Palm kernels can be used in various applications, including:<ul data-sourcepos=\"10:5-10:49\"><li data-sourcepos=\"10:5-10:49\"><strong>Palm kernel oil production:</strong> Palm kernel oil is used in cooking, baking, and the production of cosmetics and detergents.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"11:5-11:90\"><strong>Animal feed:</strong> Palm kernels can be used as a nutritious ingredient in animal feed.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"12:5-12:105\"><strong>Biofuel production:</strong> Palm kernel oil can be used as a feedstock for the production of biodiesel.</li></ul></li><li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-14:0\"><strong>Sustainability:</strong> Our palm kernels are sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.</li></ul><p><b></b></p>		\n				        	        	Other Services\n                        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/cultivation-of-high-breed-oil-palm-seedlings/\" aria-label=\"Cultivation of high breed oil palm seedlings\"><img width=\"370\" height=\"570\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-370x570.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><h3><a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/cultivation-of-high-breed-oil-palm-seedlings/\">Cultivation of high breed oil palm seedlings</a></h3>Cultivation of high breed oil palm seedlings Norsw        <a aria-label=\"button\" href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/cultivation-of-high-breed-oil-palm-seedlings/\">\n                    </a>\n                <a aria-label=\"button\" href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/cultivation-of-high-breed-oil-palm-seedlings/\">\n                    </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/processing-of-crude-palm-oil/\" aria-label=\"Palm Oil Processing\"><img width=\"370\" height=\"570\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/BRZ_2919-370x570.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><h3><a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/processing-of-crude-palm-oil/\">Palm Oil Processing</a></h3><p><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> offers comprehensive CPO processing services.</p>        <a aria-label=\"button\" href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/processing-of-crude-palm-oil/\">\n                    </a>\n                <a aria-label=\"button\" href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/processing-of-crude-palm-oil/\">\n                    </a>\n                        <a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/technical-palm-oil/\" aria-label=\"Technical Palm Oil (TPO)\"><img width=\"370\" height=\"570\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/BRZ_2664-370x570.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><h3><a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/technical-palm-oil/\">Technical Palm Oil (TPO)</a></h3><p><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> offers high-quality Technical Palm Oil (TPO)</p>        <a aria-label=\"button\" href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/technical-palm-oil/\">\n                    </a>\n                <a aria-label=\"button\" href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/technical-palm-oil/\">\n                    </a>', 'Palm kernel', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'healthy-food', '', '', '2024-08-30 21:25:40', '2024-08-30 20:25:40', '', 0, 'http://tplabs.co/agrios/?post_type=project&#038;p=510', 0, 'project', '', 0),
(598, 1, '2022-07-04 11:56:51', '2022-07-04 11:56:51', '<a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/organic-solutions/\"><img width=\"1170\" height=\"520\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/BRZ_2664-1170x520.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>		\n			<h1>Technical Palm Oil (TPO)</h1>		\n		<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:91\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> offers high-quality Technical Palm Oil (TPO), a versatile product with a wide range of industrial applications. Our TPO is produced using advanced processing techniques to ensure consistent quality and performance.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:28\"><strong>Key Features of Our TPO:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:155\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:155\"><strong>Purity and Quality:</strong> Our TPO is refined to remove impurities and contaminants, resulting in a product with excellent physical and chemical properties.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:72\"><strong>Versatility:</strong> TPO can be used in various industrial applications, including:<ul data-sourcepos=\"9:5-9:72\"><li data-sourcepos=\"9:5-9:72\"><strong>Biodiesel production:</strong> TPO is a popular feedstock for biodiesel, a renewable fuel alternative.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"10:5-10:139\"><strong>Oleochemicals:</strong> TPO is used as a raw material for the production of oleochemicals, such as fatty acids, glycerin, and surfactants.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"11:5-11:139\"><strong>Lubricants and greases:</strong> TPO can be used as a base oil for lubricants and greases, providing excellent performance and durability.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"12:5-12:115\"><strong>Food processing:</strong> TPO is used as an ingredient in certain food products, such as margarine and shortening.</li></ul></li><li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-14:0\"><strong>Sustainability:</strong> Our TPO is sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*!