(607, 1, '2022-07-04 11:57:59', '2022-07-04 11:57:59', '<a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/processing-of-crude-palm-oil/\"><img width=\"1170\" height=\"520\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/BRZ_2919-1170x520.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>		\n			<h1>Palm Oil Processing</h1>		\n		<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:118\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> offers comprehensive CPO processing services that transform raw palm fruit into valuable products. Our state-of-the-art processing facilities are equipped with advanced technology to ensure efficient and high-quality output.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:36\"><strong>Our Processing Services Include:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:1\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:1\"><strong>Fruit Sterilization:</strong> We utilize modern sterilization techniques to eliminate harmful microorganisms and preserve the quality of the palm fruit.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:34\"><strong>Fruit Threshing and Cooking:</strong> The fruits are thoroughly threshed to extract the oil-rich mesocarp, which is then cooked to facilitate oil extraction.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:31\"><strong>Oil Extraction:</strong> We employ efficient oil extraction methods, such as expeller pressing or solvent extraction, to obtain the highest possible yield of crude palm oil.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:176\"><strong>Oil Refining:</strong> Our refining process removes impurities and contaminants from the crude palm oil, resulting in a refined product that meets international quality standards.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"11:1-12:0\"><strong>By-Product Utilization:</strong> We maximize the value of by-products such as palm kernel oil and palm fiber, ensuring sustainable and efficient resource utilization.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}.e-con{--container-widget-width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer,.e-con>.