(3177, 1, '2024-08-30 18:34:40', '2024-08-30 17:34:40', '<a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/cultivation-of-high-breed-oil-palm-seedlings/\"><img width=\"1170\" height=\"520\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-1170x520.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>		\n			<h1>Cultivation of high breed oil palm seedlings</h1>		\n		<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:101\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> is committed to providing premium quality oil palm seedlings that are cultivated using advanced agricultural techniques and the latest scientific research. Our high-breed oil palm seedlings are renowned for their:</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:45\"><li data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:45\"><strong>High Yield Potential:</strong> Our seedlings are carefully selected and nurtured to produce maximum yield per hectare.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:136\"><strong>Disease Resistance:</strong> We employ rigorous quality control measures to ensure our seedlings are resistant to common oil palm diseases.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:113\"><strong>Early Maturity:</strong> Our seedlings are bred to reach maturity sooner, allowing for faster returns on investment.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:43\"><strong>Adaptability:</strong> Our seedlings are well-suited to various soil types and climatic conditions, ensuring optimal growth in different regions.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .el