(3195, 1, '2024-08-30 18:46:53', '2024-08-30 17:46:53', '<a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/organic-solutions/\"><img width=\"1170\" height=\"520\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/project-03-1170x520.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>		\n			<h1>Organic Solutions</h1>		\n		<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:91\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> offers high-quality Technical Palm Oil (TPO), a versatile product with a wide range of industrial applications. Our TPO is produced using advanced processing techniques to ensure consistent quality and performance.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:28\"><strong>Key Features of Our TPO:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:155\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:155\"><strong>Purity and Quality:</strong> Our TPO is refined to remove impurities and contaminants, resulting in a product with excellent physical and chemical properties.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-9:72\"><strong>Versatility:</strong> TPO can be used in various industrial applications, including:<ul data-sourcepos=\"9:5-9:72\"><li data-sourcepos=\"9:5-9:72\"><strong>Biodiesel production:</strong> TPO is a popular feedstock for biodiesel, a renewable fuel alternative.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"10:5-10:139\"><strong>Oleochemicals:</strong> TPO is used as a raw material for the production of oleochemicals, such as fatty acids, glycerin, and surfactants.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"11:5-11:139\"><strong>Lubricants and greases:</strong> TPO can be used as a base oil for lubricants and greases, providing excellent performance and durability.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"12:5-12:115\"><strong>Food processing:</strong> TPO is used as an ingredient in certain food products, such as margarine and shortening.</li></ul></li><li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-14:0\"><strong>Sustainability:</strong> Our TPO is sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.</li></ul>		\n			<style>/*! el