(3216, 1, '2024-08-30 21:23:55', '2024-08-30 20:23:55', '<a href=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/project/healthy-food/\"><img width=\"1170\" height=\"520\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/img-product-PK-01-1170x520.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>		\n			<h1>Healthy Food</h1>		\n		<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:109\"><strong>Norsworthy Farms</strong> offers high-quality palm kernels, a valuable by-product of palm oil production. Our palm kernels are extracted from palm fruits and processed to ensure maximum purity and nutritional content.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:37\"><strong>Key Features of Our Palm Kernels:</strong></p><ul data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:27\"><li data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:27\"><strong>High Oil Content:</strong> Our palm kernels are rich in palm kernel oil, a valuable edible oil with a wide range of applications.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:66\"><strong>Nutritional Value:</strong> Palm kernels are a good source of dietary fiber, vitamins, and minerals.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"9:1-10:49\"><strong>Versatility:</strong> Palm kernels can be used in various applications, including:<ul data-sourcepos=\"10:5-10:49\"><li data-sourcepos=\"10:5-10:49\"><strong>Palm kernel oil production:</strong> Palm kernel oil is used in cooking, baking, and the production of cosmetics and detergents.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"11:5-11:90\"><strong>Animal feed:</strong> Palm kernels can be used as a nutritious ingredient in animal feed.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"12:5-12:105\"><strong>Biofuel production:</strong> Palm kernel oil can be used as a feedstock for the production of biodiesel.</li></ul></li><li data-sourcepos=\"13:1-14:0\"><strong>Sustainability:</strong> Our palm kernels are sourced from sustainably managed palm oil plantations, ensuring that our product is produced in an environmentally responsible manner.</li></ul><p><b></b></p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.el