t/uploads/2024/08/about-2.jpg 290w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/about-2-271x300.jpg 271w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 290px) 100vw, 290px\" />\n				        	        	Get to Know Us\n	        	        <h2>Innovating Agriculture for a Greener Tomorrow</h2>\n			<h2>Driving Positive Change in Agriculture.</h2>		\n		<p>We provide our customers with quality agricultural products on demand and at competitive prices, through our commitment to sustainable environmental practices, technology driven innovations and consistent community engagements.</p>		\n				        	        	Our Mission\n	        	            Improving availability of agricultural products.\n				        	        	Our Vision\n	        	            To be a leading provider of quality and affordable agricultural products in Nigeria. \n		        <a aria-label=\"video\" \n		        		        href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hWkYtZxpQUo\">\n							        </a>\n	        	        <h2>ECO-Friendly Products can\nbe Made from Scratch</h2>\n									<img width=\"455\" height=\"299\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/line-01.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/line-01.webp 455w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/line-01-300x197.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 455px) 100vw, 455px\" />\n									<img width=\"545\" height=\"121\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/line-02.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/line-02.webp 545w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/line-02-300x67.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 545px) 100vw, 545px\" />', 'About', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '2379-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-08-30 21:51:47', '2024-08-30 20:51:47', '', 2379, 'https://norsworthy.com.ng/?p=3243', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
