70\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-04.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-04.webp 270w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/service-04-253x300.webp 253w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 270px) 100vw, 270px\" />\n                    <h3>Dairy<br> Products</h3>                \n									<img width=\"1170\" height=\"254\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-2.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-2.webp 1170w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-2-600x130.webp 600w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-2-300x65.webp 300w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-2-1024x222.webp 1024w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wheats-2-768x167.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1170px) 100vw, 1170px\" />\n				Agriculture Products			\n				Projects Completed			\n				Satisfied Clients			\n				Experts Farmers			\n			<h2>Agriculture \nMatters to the \nFuture of \nDevelopment</h2>		\n									<img width=\"1209\" height=\"375\" src=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-02.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-02.webp 1209w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-02-600x186.webp 600w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-02-300x93.webp 300w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-02-1024x318.webp 1024w, https://norsworthy.com.ng/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/farm-02-768x238.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1209px) 100vw, 1209px\" />\n				        	        	Our Testimonials\n	        	        <h2>What They\'re Talking About Agrios</h2>\n	        	            There are many variations of passages of available but the majortity have sufferred alteratio